reading. One held scroll revised — 1.2.4, the capability
profile, gains the pair of species. Foundations
1.3.141-1.3.144 (induction; a small language made for one
field; pooling; and the defined word satisficing).
Questions Q51-Q53 opened; Q16 informed a seventh time.
