- The run: the package was installed in a copy of
  the tree (its own requirements; the package at
  0.2.2). The exercise start of module 01 gave a
  notebook with exactly 3 cleared places and no
  solution marks; its tests failed as made to fail
  (the notebook tests and the module tests failed;
  the integration tests passed). The default start
  gave the same notebook whole, with 0 cleared
