- The readings of the stores (Appendix A7 of the
  paper) read against the code of the adapters in
  the same repository: the opt-in that no agent took
  stands in the storage note of the adapter of
  prime-agent (an entry made without global_=True
  belongs to its session alone); the promotion into
  MEMORY.md stands in the adapter of openclaw as a
  background consolidation, set to run each hour. The
  counts of the appendix — no lasting entry in 600
  sessions of prime-agent; the matching rule reaching
  the model on 40 of 154 returns; no promotion in
  any cell of openclaw — are the readings of the
  author over records this study holds, and no
