- The head of the repository verified against the
  head named at intake, and the whole of the material
  read as 25.1.1 records.
STATE MACHINE PASS (charter rule 13): the work is
thick with machines, and states them: seven are drawn
at 1.5.2 — the round contract and its lifecycle; the
ledger of the budget; the isolation of the frozen
tests; the spells and dormancy of the stream; the
merge of the one state of a team; the commit and fork
of kept state; and the promotion gate of openclaw,
found in the design of a third system as the work
reports it.
