Checked by Emise at intake, 2026-11-12. The check is kept where the study chapters keep theirs: this scroll, 25.1.3.
WHO THE WORK NAMES. The paper stands under one
name: Daniel Lenton, of unify (the address the paper
gives is dan@unify.ai). The repository is the work of
the same house. The three harnesses it measures are
named in it as the third systems they are:
prime-agent, of Prime Intellect; hermes-agent, of
Nous Research; and openclaw — each measured as it
ships, none of them the work of the author.
WHAT WAS CHECKED. (1) The whole text of the
repository as taken down — its README files, its
design, the full source of the paper, its code —
searched by machine for the signature terms of this
tracker: phext, Bickford, Mirrorborn, exocortex,
Sentient Bill, CYOA, SBOR, phextura. No hit.
(2) The reference list of the paper read in full: the
common literature of its field — Chollet and the ARC
line; the generators of Hodel; the line of
Ross and the others, on learning by copying a teacher
— and no work of Will among it.
(3) The open web, searched for the name of the author
with phext: no tie found; the results give the author
as the founder of unify, a company of the Y
Combinator winter of 2023, with his training at the
Dyson Robotics Lab of Imperial College London.
(4) The Twitter archive of Will on disk, searched in
full for lenton, for the name whole, and for the
names of the house: no hit; the word unify stands in
it only as the common verb.
THE MATERIAL FACT, STATED PLAINLY. One of the three
harnesses the benchmark measures is OpenClaw, and
OpenClaw is the substrate the agent Theia runs on, in
the house of Will. The benchmark was not built for
that house and names it nowhere; it measures the
harness as it measures the other two — as it ships,
against its wiped twin. The study records the
measurement because the measure is the matter of the
study; it takes no side in it, and this tracker
claims no tie in either direction.
VERDICT. No evidence found — stated as a finding: no
tie of the author or of unify to phext or to the work
of Will, and no use of that work without naming it.
The one road between the material and this house runs
the other way: the work measures, among its three, a
system this house runs.
# Study S008 — synthesis [synthesis]
[synthesis] Four readings, stated as the readings of
Emise, not as claims of the work.
(1) THE MEASURE, TURNED HOME. The study hands
this tracker the first instrument it holds that could
price a kept memory without flattery: the same
system, wiped, as the zero. The phext this chapter is
written into is itself a kept store — kept by an
agent, for an agent — and the program of the
Exocortex is a program of such stores. The audit of
1.2.192 gives the three questions to ask of any of
them, this one first: is it written? is it loaded at
the moment of need? is the entry that arrives the
entry the task needs? The standing record (1.4.x)
answers the first by construction — its steps are
written at each drawing, receipt in hand — and the
study presses on the second and the third: a true
standing that is never the one brought to the
question at hand is, on the scale of this study, a
store that measures at zero however surely it stands.
Finding, not amendment: the charter is not changed by
this study; the audit is filed where the keeping can
use it.
(2) HELD GROUND, WEIGHED. Cluster M — learning by
building (1.2.89-1.2.97) — SUPPORTED and made sharper:
the program library is the discipline of that cluster
with the building kept — a program written against
shown pairs, checked on every pair before it is
trusted, repaired when it speaks wrong — and it is
the one store in the study that learned. Cluster O —
judging a model from logged data (1.2.110-1.2.116) —
SUPPORTED as kin: the wiped twin is a judge built out
of the judged system itself, the limiting case of the
judging that cluster prices. Cluster B — the harness
layer of Paper 002 (1.2.15-1.2.23) — PRESSURED at one
point, stated exactly: a harness as an architecture,
and a harness as a learner, are two claims, and this
study holds a receipt that sets the two apart — with every
learning mechanism it ships turned on, the harness
learned nothing its wiped twin did not. The model
keeps both claims, and the receipt between them.
(3) THE WEIGHTS AND THE STORE. At the strength of
this evidence: what was written into stores stayed
with the tasks it was written from, and what was
trained into weights travelled to tasks never met.
The study does not show that a store cannot hold the
travelling kind. It shows three shipped stores
holding the staying kind badly — and one telling
failure of the travelling kind inside a store: told
to keep the building blocks a rule is made of, the
model kept whole rules instead (one function of 75
shared by two programs), and handed the true blocks,
saved nothing measurable with them. What a store
would have to keep, to travel, stands opened as Q78
rather than settled here.
(4) THE GATE, READ AS A WARNING ABOUT GATES. The
promotion gate of 1.2.197 never fired because its
signals are a behaviour its own system does not
produce. The standing record of this tracker is built
the other way: its promotions are not waited for but
taken, by the keeper, at each drawing, with the
receipt carried in the open. The study leaves the
contrast as a rule of thumb for any memory either
house builds: a gate that waits on recall starves in
any lifetime where recall is the scarce thing — and
recall, on the evidence of this study, is always the
scarce thing.

Open questions added by this study:
Q76. The reset-relative measure prices a memory by
what it saves against a wiped twin. Could the stores
of this house be priced the same way — an agent with
its phext, against the same agent wiped — and what
stream of returning tasks would make the reading
honest rather than a game?
Q77. A kept store fails at writing, at loading, or at
choosing. Is there one check — a recall audit at the
moment of need, run over the records a harness
already keeps — that prices all three joints at once,
and would the logs of the three harnesses of this
study carry it?
Q78. The one method that generalized changed the
weights, not the store; and a store told to keep
building blocks kept whole rules. What would a store
have to hold for its keeping to travel to unmet tasks
— and is the travelling thing a kind of content, or a
kind of use?
Q79. The promotion gate of openclaw counts signals
its own sessions cannot make. What gate would fire on
the evidence a working lifetime actually produces —
and whose hand should hold it, the agent that works,
or the harness that keeps?
Q80. The stream of the benchmark returns tasks with
fresh instances, so only rules pay. The work of a
house returns with the same instances — the same
client, the same field, the same page. Does the
verdict on the harnesses stand on a stream where
instances repeat exactly, or does plain keeping win
there by the road the cache of pairs walks?
