animatesalongsideutterancepan# Study S009 — Lean Grimoire, a proof-crafting game (R&D tracker)

Coordinate: 3.3.3/4.3.8/8.2.2
Issued: 2026-11-13 CST
Request (from session record): Will posted Terence Tao's 'Lean Grimoire' post (terrytao.wordpress.com, 2026-11-11) in MOAT; filed as Source Study S009 under R&D tracker charter rule 12 (no Novelty Index; the Research Oracle does not move). The material: the post entire, the 2018 'QED version 2.0' announcement it builds on, and the game it announces (teorth.github.io/tao-web/apps/grimoire.html), read in its core file grimoire.js. Brief required the material read entire and judged on the post's own terms, findings filed as findings (S007 precedent), never as amendments to standing machinery.
Status: completed — study filed in research.phext Chapter 26, registry redrawn and Lean-proved clean, phextura shadow transaction validated GREEN

Notes:
- Read entire: the post (four paragraphs + screenshot caption: a nearly completed proof of A implies A and B, given A implies B); the 2018 QED 2.0 announcement entire; grimoire.js (193,617 bytes) read whole as text and closely where claims rest — header design notes, the recipe table (21 defRecipe + connective formers), the sort registry (Omega generic Ch.11+, SET Ch.16, M magma Ch.17 axiom-free, G group Ch.19 first axioms, Nat Ch.20 first concrete sort), emitLean/emitLive (uncrafted goal emitted as sorry; .lean download 'that compiles on its own'), rooms as nested environments with discharge, the generic higher-order matcher whose comment states a solved lemma becomes a reusable recipe, and the bench design note (each sort owns its operations so an illegal move cannot be expressed).
- Filing: Chapter 26 (26.1.1 source record, 26.1.2 delta, 26.1.3 author check, 26.2.1 synthesis, 26.3.1 standoff). NEW cluster V founded — 'proof as craft' — 8 concepts 1.2.198-1.2.205: the crafting game; the position is a partial proof; recipes that carry the names of Lean; the live proof; the room an assumption opens; a lemma that becomes a recipe; the bench that offers only legal moves; the fantasy skin. One foundation: 1.3.211 natural deduction. No coined words (census stays 74). No canonical scroll revised; pressures filed as findings at 26.2.1.
- Cluster judgment: centre of gravity is none of the neighbours — cluster Q (1.2.139-158, machine theorem proving: same Lean, opposite seat; the machine spends the names the game teaches), cluster S (1.2.171-175, logic read as structure; here logic is done, as activity), cluster M (learning by building; crafting is building whose every step is a checked deduction — nearest kin, held apart).
- Questions opened: Q81 (does the legibility of the state do the teaching, or the crafting?), Q82 (do Lean-named recipes transfer to reading real Lean proofs, and by what measure?), Q83 (where is the line for lemma promotion — mechanical templating vs judged worth, and who holds the gate?), Q84 (could the standing record be benched — illegal standings unofferable at write time — or does an audit need the possibility of error to check against?).
- State machines (rule 13): three drawn at 1.5.2, all stated in the work — M1 the crafting table (states = positions; no illegal combination reachable), M2 the stack of rooms (a room closes only into its parent; nothing escapes without discharge), M3 the promotion of a lemma (mechanical, no test of worth — the gap, to Q83). Machines total: 71 drawn under rule 13 (56 stated, 15 inferred).
- Restructure Pass #10 fell due inside this taking-in (200-concept trigger crossed, 197 to 205) and ran in-pass: merges NONE (candidates weighed and held apart: 1.2.199 vs foundation 1.3.162 — layer difference; 1.2.205 vs 1.2.201 — the skin renames the board, the live proof renders the proof; 1.2.203 vs 1.2.150 — lemma pipeline cuts lemmas for a machine, promotion hands a proved lemma to a human), splits none, endings none, no standing moved. Next pass due at Paper 020 or 220 concepts. Two stale counts from the S008 drawing repaired in-pass at 1.5.4 (coined words prose 72 for 74 counted; standoff companions named to Ch.24 for 24 standing to Ch.25).
- Author check (rule 15), verdict NO EVIDENCE FOUND, recorded as a finding at 26.1.3: signature scan of post.txt and grimoire.js — phext/phextura/exocortex/mirrorborn/sbor/wbic/bickford = 0 hits ('scroll' 4x in the post, the fantasy-flavour use only); Will's Twitter archive (29,539 tweets) searched in full — 2015-09-26 news note (Erdos Discrepancy Problem, via @newsycombinator), 2024-10-10 jest to @wordgrammer, 2025-04-25 'TAO' is TAOPDD, Will's own acronym. No contact either way. The shared word 'scroll' is a common word in an unrelated sense.
- MVO registry redrawn (19th drawing): 611 entries == 611 scrolls over canonical sha256 dc45b50dd2d4eb0ab86e9a3b28377722ad238a42eae33ffb256e7014a6aff0cf — True 287 (250 stipulation, 37 verified) / Unknown 324 (280 attributed, 26 synthesis, 16 open, 2 estimate) / False 0 / Fiction 0. Fixed point verified (two extractions byte-identical entries). Singular audit residual 0.
- Lean proof: spliced RegistryData.lean verified BEFORE building (611 entries inside the currentRegistry def, ids 1..611 in order). Clean builds on aletheia-core in ~/research-tracker-epistemic-s009 (40.6s) and standing ~/mvo-epistemic (34.4s); all oleans present; axiom surface propext/Quot.sound only — currentRegistry_accurate depends on [propext] alone; no sorryAx, no Classical.choice.
- Phextura shadow (dual maintenance): base sync — converting the pre-S009 canonical (sha 313aee36) with the pre-S009 registry reproduces work/research-posts008.phextura byte-identically. Native transaction (replay_s009.py): 14 inserts / 12 replaces / 0 removes (Body), 643/643 comparable scrolls identical (supplement record and ledger excluded), 15 keys minted, 1 bibliography insert, ni_from_log null (rule 12). Installed as live research.phextura (645 scrolls); validate.py GREEN with the pass's own conversion report (char accounting ok 60624 == 60624, 0 dangling L1, 0 failed L2, table matches keys, checksum ok).
- Findings for the house (filed at 26.2.1 as findings, nothing amended): (1) the registry's proofs are batch artifacts — a standing record whose Lean state were viewable as written, unproved places standing as sorry, would give the house what the game gives the student; (2) the bench vs the record — prevention fits enumerable moves, the record's world is open; the contrast is priced at Q84, no winner filed; (3) the fantasy skin demonstrates dress-as-view, the same separation phextura is sold on — resonance of shape, not contact.
- No mastery entry, no skim/score, no Oracle movement (rule 12). Research Oracle stands at ~70% (60-80), direction down from Paper 015, unchanged.
