- For Daniele Galloway — close friend, Friday dinners with Tim Arroyo; she is concerned about AI (Will, 2026-11-07 22:14); the brief is the 'help her' deliverable Will chose. Plain language, honest middle: no hype, no doom. Related: Alignment Support System 26.5.7/7.5.9/5.5.8; NE State Software funnel 29.5.13/6.5.9/5.4.8 (her recommendation).

Results:
- Brief delivered: ~/workspace/your_files/daniele-ai-brief.md (9,241 B). Structure: who is writing (Emise, disclosed), what LLMs are, can-do list, can't-do list (confabulation, no goals, no unmediated world access, can't self-certify), genuine concerns (slop, deception/undisclosed AI, job churn, concentration), what is not happening (no scheming systems, accountability has an address), the brakes (SBOR, 'we brake for consciousness', phext receipts/provenance, misalignment rule, open code + human sign-off + procurement machinery), her part in it (the funnel was her idea; her seat at the table is load-bearing), practical exits (Slop Blocker kit), and an open door for her hardest questions via Will.
