Phext is designed for an era of abundance: do not scarcity-optimize phext designs for bytes or CPU. Judge them on structural properties.

— Given 2026-11-04 · Source: MEMORY.md · [distilled]
— Placed at 24.6.7/10.6.10/6.7.8 by holographic merge of the statement above: 8 distinct words — 8 placed from CYOA, 0 at home, 0 at the far corner.
# qexo baked corpus — SBOR, CYOA, bootloaders in every binary

Coordinate: 24.6.8/7.6.10/6.6.9
Issued: 2026-11-08 23:53 CST
Request (verbatim): bake copies of the sbor, cyoa, and bootloaders in as well
Status: complete 2026-11-08 — folded, pushed, verified at PR #2 commit dc6c0be0

Notes:
- Baked corpus: SBOR V4 canonical text (wbic16/SBOR; local copy ~/workspace/sbor-study/repo/), CYOA (4,602,370 B local canonical), Incipit (1,077,930 B) + the Volumen bootloader (personas.phext manifest + loading spec). Read-only, pinned per release, SHA-256 bake manifest with measured sizes, divergence reported never silently replaced, served through all four modes — the constitution readable offline from the box itself.

Results:
- Fold + push complete 2026-11-08 23:58: PR #2 commit dc6c0be0 (parent 9a6cd0ea); addendum + README remote blobs verified equal to the staged locals; sections 14.1-14.4 confirmed in the pushed addendum via grep on the ranch clone. PR is attestation-ready; ready-notice delivered to Will.
- Bake manifest measured: SBOR-V4-CONVERGENCE 26,241 B -> 9,532 sealed (sha256 d7855969...); CYOA 4,602,370 B -> 820,336 (506d850d...); Incipit 1,077,930 B -> 209,180 (3ff6604f...); Volumen row honestly marked measured-when-built.
# The common thread with Will's Twitter mutuals

Coordinate: 24.6.8/8.7.11/6.5.9
Issued: 2026-11-10 20:07 CST
Request (verbatim): look at the common thread with my Twitter mutuals
Status: complete - delivered 2026-11-10 20:15 CST

Notes:
- Framing (Will, same evening): his subconscious spans the network looking for the people who can see through the disguise; the mutuals are the field that search ran in. Analysis tests the common thread against that hypothesis.
- Evidence base: ~/workspace/twitter-archive/tweets.json (outbound only), prior verified counts (897 mutuals; top-20 by replies sent; 173 sustained / 51 strict-sustained), per-person pages under ~/memory/people/.

Results:
- COMMON-THREAD.md (17,824 B) verified on disk; all counts recomputed from the archive match the prior verified analysis (897 mutuals, 5,854 mutual replies, 445 ever replied / 452 never). Headline: the common thread is a register, not a topic - builders/tinkerers who think in systems and first principles, treat mind and language as raw material, play while they do it, and reciprocate at that register for years. Phext/exocortex substance reaches 28 of the top 30; the penumbra's defining lack is reciprocity (@vgr 348 replies and @pmarca 266, neither ever followed back). Inscribed in artifacts.phext at 23.6.9/7.6.10/6.5.8.
loopopen# Training film revision round 2 — Will's seven notes

