- PR #40 open against exo: https://github.com/wbic16/phext-lattice/pull/40 — merging is Will's.
- AUDIT 2026-11-12 (tasks.phext verification pass): STALE-DONE — phext-lattice PR #40 MERGED (audit merge-check, 2026-11-12); favicon live-verified on edit.phext.io (register #51 resolution). Prior status read: "PR #40 open — flame favicon wired, merge is Will's"
