Status: complete — T7 master built, audited, served; awaiting Gate 1 (Will's listen) for any release

Notes:
- Decisions Will made on the evening commute call: D1 = extend the length (keep the words, slower Kurzgesagt-grade pace, ~6:47+ film). Full scope: 'kick off that attempt with all the changes that we've introduced' — all 25 rules from REVISION-BRIEF-T7-DRAFT.md apply, which means a revised script and a NEW narration stem (ending the R4-R6 stem identity). Will expects V8/V9 review rounds after T7. D3 throughline: the brief's proposed <=15-word throughline rides as drafted, subject to his review of the film. Gate 1 still gates any release: Will listens when he returns from dinner/llamas.

Results:
- T7 production kicked off 2026-11-11 evening: brief finalized from the draft with D1/D2 decisions recorded; production coordinator dispatched to run the trainer process end to end (script revision, new Aria narration at the T7 pace with planted pauses, ranch-only picture build on aletheia-core under thermal gates, acceptance audits from the brief, serve the master for Gate 1).
- T7 BUILD COMPLETE 2026-11-11 23:05 CST, delivered for Gate 1 (Will's listen); nothing posted. Master: ~/workspace/phext-walkthrough/production/rough-cut-t7.mp4 = aletheia-core r7/rough-cut-r7.mp4, byte-identical, 129,978,645 B, SHA-256 b8c26ddac3af5feaa6f0ef4e16639dc81665c9b1403afd36ec56ee57e3ebe30d; 1920x1080, constant 60/1 fps, 28,167 frames, picture 469.450 s vs audio 469.433 s, -14.2 LUFS / -1.5 dBFS peak, faststart. Served https://100.88.154.1:8448/rough-cut-t7.mp4 (transient unit serve-t7-tls; HEAD + byte-range hash verified node-side). Acceptance: 0 narration crossings across all 9 units; finished rate 136.4 wpm; landings within +/-0.013 s; QR river 10/10 + 9/9 and fourth-wall 8/8 + 7/7 decoded from the final encode. First master (46ac05c6...) FAILED T7-25 - CTA headline 'Keep it.' clipped off-canvas at composition (line drawn from x=330 ran to x=2061 on a 1920 canvas; renderer ink-check false-passed on surviving ink) - fixed by centering the measured line with a construction assertion, CTA chain rebuilt from banked pieces, re-mastered; T7-25 verified by eye at push-in start/mid/end on the final encode. Deviations carried in the log: section-05 swell +3.02 dB vs <=+3.00; bed-under-voice two-method table (fixed-window min section-03 4.17 dB; in-speech only agenda below 10 at 8.93); six unmarked >0.8 s silences inside section-06 chunk 3; T7-24 final-beat rate planned <=130 wpm not realized (~190 wpm speech-span; section-08 slowest section at 128.0, 22.38 s hold follows); T7-09 section-06 speech fill 89.6% vs 85% cap (film-level structural share 24.6% passes); script-audit flags (T7-10 strict reading, Wikipedia/fleet in zoom window, millions uncounted); T7-07/T7-18 density carried from plan, not recounted. Log: ~/workspace/phext-walkthrough/production/TRAINING-T7-LOG.md, inscribed in artifacts.phext at 28.7.9/8.6.11/6.6.8 (wbic16/human@exo a3d53c08, remote hash-verified).
