No phext coordinate component is ever below 1

No implementation permits a coordinate component less than 1 — coordinates are 1-based by definition, in every implementation. Input values from negative infinity to 0 are undefined behaviour: an implementation may handle them however it likes, but it may never emit or hold a component below 1.

