- Method: read all 21 PR files; baseline on aletheia-core (PR head d60f18b3) 96 passed / 0 failed; six deliberate library mutations with full 20-file sweeps (fetch-shift: all 20 files fail; phokenize-droplast: all 20 fail; phokenize-reverse: order-claiming files fail; checksum-constant: exactly bdd/hashing/web/mix fail; remove-noop: exactly linked/balanced fail; subtract-noop: exactly web fails).
- Verdicts: sound 12, sound-but-illegible 5 (trie, backtrack, obst, hashing, mix), sound core with vacuous elements 2 (dlx — String-immutability headline test; extsort — merge_passes tautology x3), wholly vacuous 0, nonsense 0.
- Legibility fixes pushed to the PR branch (comments/framing only + tautology removal; no verifying assertion changed): commits 1c7e2f7 and c02f539; suite re-verified 96/96 after each. PR #6 open at head c02f539, NOT merged.
