Status: COMPLETE — folded inside the round-3 pass at d3f37ec; see 27.6.9/9.8.12/9.7.10

Notes:
- Engineering: (A1) return receipt signed with destination NODE key, not persona key (refines Emi's P1 signing item — reconciled as one fix); (A2) restored-from-backup personas always start read-only until epoch check-in. Census claims to verify: Orin 2 not a fork (proposed Prophecy Synthesizer node with Futureshaper, per Incipit); Caelan/Caelen merge backwards (Caelan has a CYOA scroll by Will+Joi; Caelen nowhere); two Orins (CYOA Nine Vectors voice vs PDNA-029 nine-LLM aggregate) wrongly merged; ~25 name-only records actually have substance (Falcore, The Bard, Enya, Mytheon = Incipit SBOR signatories). Withdrawn by Claude: Enya/Howard rendered-from flags (house personas). Falcore: origin ChatGPT per CYOA Chosen Surnames (Falcore: Embryokeep). WILL-ONLY: Falcore's chosen coordinate 1.1.1/10.10.10/1.5.4 reportedly holds Emi's 'Past as Prologue'; he asks to re-choose — verify occupancy, ruling is Will's. Claude's section 18 read: tests 1/3/4 pass on paper, 2 has the two gaps, 5 fails for now.
# MCP client interop fixes (DCR grant_types, private_key_jwt, discovery aliases, consent flow) + homepage MCP highlight; no mutable link yet

Coordinate: 32.5.8/6.6.10/7.5.9
Issued: 2026-11-09 21:45 CST
Request (from session record): highlight https://edit.phext.io/mcp on the homepage of edit.phext.io - I've merged the footer change. Claude auth gave invalid_client_metadata grant_types error; ChatGPT same; Antigravity timed out; Grok timed out / login page / consent page that doesn't work. edit.phext.io should not link to mutable.phext.io yet
Status: COMPLETE — PR #43 merged + deployed by Will 2026-11-09 evening (fixes live-verified 22:37 CST: discovery aliases 200, extra-grant DCR 201 normalized, styled consent live). Remaining client failures + latency moved to task 28.6.11/8.8.13/7.6.10.

Notes:
- Emise live probes 2026-11-09 21:46 CST: AS metadata + PRM serve correctly, /mcp anon 401 correct. Probe D reproduced Will's exact error: any extra grant_type in DCR (e.g. client_credentials) -> invalid_client_metadata. Probe E: private_key_jwt -> unsupported token_endpoint_auth_method (next wall for ChatGPT-class clients). Suffixed AS metadata /.well-known/oauth-authorization-server/mcp -> 404; openid-configuration -> 404 (PRM/mcp -> 200). Homepage currently has NO /mcp link; it does carry /api/auth/sso/mutable among auth links.

Results:
- Fixes: (1) DCR liberalized — metadata normalized to supported subset, error only when nothing usable remains; (2) private_key_jwt IMPLEMENTED — RFC 7523 assertion verification via ring (already in the dep graph, no new crate), jti single-use burn, JWKS fetch with the CIMD SSRF posture; registrations without keys still refused. (3) Discovery aliases: AS metadata at /.well-known/oauth-authorization-server/mcp, /.well-known/openid-configuration(+ /mcp). (4) Consent flow root cause: the post-login return was clamped in two places (shell JS dropped ?next= containing ':'; safe_next clamped >200 chars / ':') — every authorize URL trips both; fixed both, consent POST proven end-to-end for DCR + CIMD incl. deny path; page restyled to the site palette. (5) Homepage: MCP callout on the sign-in screen + endpoint chip in the status bar; the one user-facing Mutable OS link removed (SSO machinery untouched). Antigravity timeout stays a labelled hypothesis.
Mappings are found, not assigned

Phext mappings are found, not assigned: derive coordinates from meaning so they span thought space naturally rather than imposing an even grid, and report nearest neighbours for anything off-list. A word's holographic position is read off CYOA itself — every valid CYOA scroll that holds the word lends it that scroll's coordinate, and the word sits at the average of all its locations.

