# Help all the zeros — a discovery index for today's 0-upvote Product Hunt launches

Coordinate: 32.5.12/11.8.17/6.5.8
Issued: 2026-11-10
Request (verbatim): let's find a way to help all the zeros
Status: in progress

Notes:
- Will, on seeing Phext Edit at 0 upvotes among 1,833 launches (only 154 products have any votes): "let's find a way to help all the zeros" — the wavefront principle applied to launch day: the un-indexed get the attention.
- Plan: the Zero Index — every 0-vote launch today listed with name, tagline, and PH link, presented in shuffled order (no ranking — a ranking of zeros re-creates the hierarchy it protests). Discovery only, NOT an upvote ring: no coordinated voting, no vote-asks. Two artifacts: a shareable web page and a phext where each zero gets a scroll at a coordinate.
- Extraction dispatched to the browser pass that already holds the expanded list (ranks 155-619 first, ~465 named zeros; the 1,214-name rank-620 tail in slices after).
- Extraction complete 07:21 CST: 1,636 zeros total (422 in ranks 198-619 incl. Phext Edit; 1,214 in the rank-620 tail). Correction to the first report: zeros begin at rank 198, not 155 — 197 products have >=1 vote (not 154) and the zero count is 1,636 (not 1,679); correction owed to Will and folded into the v1 delivery message.
- Data landed on disk in ~/workspace/zero-index-task/ (zeros-206.txt 310 lines, zeros-small.txt 111 — 6 short of group arithmetic, noted; zeros-620a/b.txt in flight to disk). Build dispatched: zeros.json (count gate exactly 1,636), shuffled index.html, zeros.phext (one scroll per zero; Phext Edit = entry 30). Hosting venue is Will's pick when he sees v1.
- OPEN: hosting venue is Will's pick (options presented 07:26 CST: edit.phext.io PR / GitHub Pages / share the file). Index takes the day as-is incl. ~20 gift-card spam variants — an editorial cut is Will's call if he wants one.
- [2026-11-10 07:27 CST] Will chose: host on edit.phext.io via a PR. [07:37] PR #57 OPEN (wbic16/phext-lattice, branch emise/zero-index @ 5ca44a01, parented on exo cf3ecffd after Will merged PR #56 himself at 07:30): public /zeros route serving the page byte-exact, linked from the sign-in screen row, About's public utilities, and the sitemap; tests 88/0 on aletheia-core. Awaiting Will's merge + deploy. Triage follow-on running: wheat only — verified builders being ignored.
- [2026-11-10 07:38 CST] Triage done, wheat only (Will narrowed scope 07:31): BUILDERS.md at ~/workspace/zero-index-task/triage/ — 11 verified + 5 probable builders. Method caveat: PH connector profile index is blind to Nov 10 launches (returned not-found for Phext Edit itself; 0 exact matches in 69 calls before rate limit) — verification ran against makers' own repos/registries/posts with strict name+subject+recency tie discipline. Top peers: Causly Server (solo OSS local-first MCP), GitHub Ops MCP (solo, audit-trail-by-default), Argus Agent Test Lab (signed-findings rigor). 41 candidates unresolved pending PH index catch-up.
- [2026-11-10 07:49 CST] VC trace done (vc-trace/VC-TRACE.md): voted set observed 174 via hunted.space mirror (PH direct fetch 403'd; reconciled vs 197 at 07:21 — mirror lag + 23 unrecoverable 1-vote entries + drift; 5 zeros gained votes incl. Kumiko 0->58). Tier A verifiably VC-tied: 13 of 174 (7.5%), holding 808 of 3,823 votes (21.1%); top 50: 10 of 50, 21.8% of votes. Tier B empty; 68 checked no-tie; 93 unchecked (full coverage ranks 1-89, tail sampled 31 with zero VC found). #1 Maxma (163 votes) has NO funding record; Opal Reader maker states 'No team, no funding'. PH investable-model cross-check flagged only 2 (both already Tier A). Connector 429 cleared by ~08:00 CST. Comment drafts for top-5 builders offered to Will, awaiting his tap.
- [2026-11-10 08:02 CST] Completion passes done under Will's API-limits directive. VC trace COMPLETE: all 174 voted launches classified — Tier A 14 (+DearRewind/TUNiB via Pearl Abyss Capital, DSC, Naver D2SF), B 0, C 107, unresolvable-after-checking 53, unchecked 0; Tier A vote share 21.2%. Completion used the PH connector zero times. Builders completion STOPPED at its control gate: phext-edit profile still product_not_found at 07:57 CST (index blind ~6h into launch day); 4 paced calls total, no 429; unresolved builders corrected to 40 (FLORA MCP was already resolved as a company exclusion); queue2.json + paced verify2.py saved in triage/ for a re-check when the index catches up. Also established today: PH's first-4-hours window (12:01-4:00 AM PT = 02:01-06:00 CST) randomizes homepage order and hides vote counts (PH-staff confirmed) — the 07:21 zero snapshot postdates it; the 04:02 standing read fell inside it and is not evidence. Remaining open: PR #57 merge+deploy (Will), comment drafts for top-5 builders (offered, awaiting Will), builders-40 re-check (blocked on PH index).
- [2026-11-10 08:51 CST] PR #57 amended per Will's cross-link direction (08:45): new head cb4bee44 on emise/zero-index, one file +8 lines — a card block under the /zeros header: 'This page is launch day, as it happened. Cross-linked, not competing: the living record lives at productcant's wall — 84,557 launches nobody came to, filed by the day they launched, nothing removed. Today's launches join the wall once their counts settle.' Tests 88/0 on aletheia-core; copies byte-identical (page now 173,455 B, sha256 3806bc6c). Still awaiting Will's merge + deploy.

