- Recommended stack: OBS capture; Will records final narration (TTS scratch for timing); Descript primary edit (Hobbyist $16/mo billed yearly as reported Nov 2026), DaVinci Resolve free fallback, Camtasia Essentials $179.88/yr if walkthroughs become a series; script-derived captions; YouTube Studio + X native publish after Will's approval.
