- Carry tool: tools/upstream_carry.py (new, 100755, self-contained stdlib; phext byte format + walk/implode are the phcc/phst importer lineage's; binary form is the canonical libphext 0.5.0 phext-binary:1:base64). Layout mirrors phst: identity scroll, placement manifest (path, coordinate, SHA-256, size, git mode, encoding), layout notes, exclusions register, file-grain Source Vol 2 (Book = top-level area), endmark.
