- Hashes: upstream.phext 4,631,003 B, SHA-256 54d69d4b2bd056e9438746c5fdc8f65e8e85b4f3be13be559acb3ad9f9586a5a (does NOT ship). upstream.phext.xz 798,620 B (17.2% of plain), SHA-256 5e98c6d163430874c9287ff101a964149b4e142a3a12a962604b54d439d3eec8 — sealed with the repo's own phcc seal (tools/phcc_builds.py: xz, CRC64, preset 9 extreme), the same recipe as phcc.phext.xz. Committed blob re-hashed after commit: identical.
- Round-trip proof (rock-mountain, 2026-11-09): phcc unseal of the seal reproduces the plain phext byte-identically (SHA-256 equal); unpack from the unsealed phext = 558/558 files, every file SHA-256-verified against the in-phext manifest, 0 failures; independent diff -r --no-dereference vs a second fresh checkout of the pin = 0 differences; executable-bit parity exact (6 x 100755 in both trees).
