Coordinate: 40.14.18/16.14.22/15.14.20
Issued: 2026-11-07
Request (verbatim): build all the on ramps for all age groups notes above
Status: complete — closed by audit 2026-11-12 (work already done; evidence in results)

Notes:
- Scope per ~/workspace/roads-to-the-future/AGES-0-20.md: 15 new games. 0-2: Tap Home, Zap Listen Mode. 3-5: Sort the Scrolls, One Number Road, Echo Tiles. 10-12: Scroll Seeker, Place a Word. 13-15: Kardashev Climb, Find It Fast, Exocortex Quest I. 16-17: Neuralese, The Long Road (CYOA). 18-20: Your Own Archive, Runway, The Choir.
- Shared chassis at every age: Will's greeting opens the game; free forever, same-screen multiplayer where the band supports it, no accounts/tracking, compliance footers (About/Privacy/Terms); brick ratio follows the age dial in AGES-0-20.md; real data only (Singular atlas extract: ~/workspace/roads-to-the-future/atlas-top80.tsv).
- Build in batches by band, youngest first; each verified, exported, and pushed to wbic16/site-apertureshift-com@exo with a rebuilt hub index organized by age band.

Results:
- AUDIT 2026-11-12 (tasks.phext verification pass): STALE-DONE — all 15 new age-band games present in repo tree snapshots (tree-fresh.json; verify-2026-11-11) alongside the rebuilt hub. Prior status read: "In progress: batch 1 (ages 0-5) dispatched 2026-11-07."
