Request (verbatim): let's get the long-term deployment process for https://mutable.phext.io/ sorted out - I want to deploy from https://github.com/wbic16/mutable-os, but have the deployment runner automatically sync from upstream at https://github.com/argimenes/mutable-os. Make any adjustments necessary - and also open a PR to merge the phext support (only) into upstream - keep the SSO process as a set of patches we apply during deployment.
Status: complete — purity PURE, CI/CD built + dry-run-verified, upstream PR prepared but blocked on credentials

Notes:
- Existing discipline: mutable-upstream-sync skill (two-band stack; phext band upstream-bound; SSO band never upstream; nightly trial sync exists; promotion is per-sync approved, standing ratification PENDING — the runner must stop at an approval gate, no unattended go-live).
- Will ratified unattended go-live (2026-11-09 20:04 CST): 'unattended go-live for mutable.phext.io is fine - we will be watching his upstream repo for updates and automatically deploying them as a continuous CI/CD process.' The approval gate is removed; verification itself is the gate (failed build/tests/conflict/purity blocks the deploy and reports). Amendment sent to the dispatched worker; skill + MEMORY updates follow in this session.
- Result (2026-11-09 20:08 CST): Part A PURE (3 independent checks over the 154-file band diff; standing script check-band-purity.sh in the sync-pipeline). Part B BLOCKED: no duplicate PR exists; VM token gets 403 on argimenes/mutable-os (fine-grained repo selection doesn't cover it); aletheia-core's gh token is expired. PR title/body staged on aletheia-core /tmp/pr-title.txt + /tmp/pr-body.md. Unblock is Will's: extend the token's repo access, re-auth gh on aletheia-core, or open from the web UI. Part C: promote-and-deploy.sh (5 stages) + deploy-pipeline.conf + cron mutable-cicd-deploy ~04:44 CST daily; dry run exit 0, nothing deployed. SSO-at-deploy-time realized via env-gating (sso-auth.ts inert without box-only secrets) — flagged for Will's confirmation. One unproven link: sudo -n -u ubuntu from wbic16's key-only session may not be policy-granted (exit 44 if not; one-time sudoers drop-in fixes it).

Results:
- deployment-process.md in the mutable goal's files/; promote-and-deploy.sh + check-band-purity.sh + deploy-pipeline.conf in hidden_files/sync-pipeline/; cron mutable-cicd-deploy (~04:44 CST)
