Notes:
- Will, MOAT, 2026-11-11 01:08 CST - named 'the key innovation'. L1 = phext coordinates (scrolls in one corpus); L2 = addresses for research objects (theorems, claims, figures, papers, authors, concepts) persisting across editions, re-basing, and papers, resolving to L1 via corpus-carried mapping data. Design agent dispatched to write LAYER2.md (model, draft grammar, priced resolution, edition-drift worked example on the demo corpus, verdict on the loop's PROPOSE (2) edition-qualified citation, honest limits incl. anti-rot) and publish it to phextura@exo; DESIGN.md amendments listed as proposals only.
- 2026-11-11 01:10 CST: Will refined in three beats - L2 is (1) the first GLOBAL address scheme for phext, durable BETWEEN phextura files; (2) NOT phext addresses - coordinates are internal to each phextura; (3) its purpose is COMPOSITION of multiple phextura files. Corrections sent into the design agent's brief immediately (global scope supersedes the corpus-internal resolution framing; grammar must not look like coordinates; composition becomes the worked example). Interjection log entry 5 written.
- COMPLETED 2026-11-11 01:16 CST. LAYER2.md (754 lines) published to phextura@exo 81090f879f, blob verified. Distinction: L1 names a scroll's position in one file and means nothing outside it; L2 names a research object in a named phextura file and resolves in any verified copy. Grammar (DRAFT): px2: + work-ref (arxiv:/doi:/corpus:/sum:xxh3-128:) + optional @e: edition pin + #kind:key; 19 v1 kinds + claim/paper/author/concept; keys minted once, object table in Collection 6 (derived index + append-only ledger, aliases/tombstones). Resolution: warm Theta(1) expected, cold Theta(B+O), composition linear; nine loud failure modes. Composition worked example: three files compose with NO merge and NO re-basing (all keep root 1.1.1); P13 split proposed (binding=merge vs citing=L2). PROPOSE (2) verdict: L2 SUBSUMES and supersedes it - (checksum, coordinate) demoted to resolution receipt; formal closing of (2) awaits Will's word. Honest limits: work names can rot (pins/checksum form mitigate), durability of denotation is not durability of archives, L2 confers no authority; authoring cost UNPRICED pending the P14 benchmark. Spec honesty note: demo corpus predates L2, example pin is its SHA-256 prefix as labelled stand-in. DESIGN.md untouched; eight integration proposals listed in LAYER2 Sec.10. Conversion program (task 26.7.9) notified - its Phase 1 gate is lifted.
