- Merge-verified 3 ways (API + merge-check + is-ancestor in fresh clone): #43, #44, #45, #46, #47 all in exo @ ffdd31e7; ZERO open PRs remain against phext-lattice. Tests on aletheia-core fresh clone: workspace 265 passed / 1 failed; MCP harness 73/0, steps 0-9ms. The one failure: local_editor_regression debug-build latency budget (GET /singular.html <50ms) measuring 60.7-65.1ms — bisected: v1.0.0 code passes on the same node; a real +16ms fixed per-request cost crept in across PRs #41-#47 in DEBUG builds; the RELEASE build (what deploys) serves that page in ~6.3ms, / in ~0.8ms — production impact ~1-2ms. Non-blocking; documented in the release notes with a post-release profiling follow-up. #45's version-bump commit also closed the old cosmetic gap: Cargo.toml now reads 1.1.0. Tag: annotated v1.1.0 object 66da2c40 -> ffdd31e7, pushed git-over-SSH from aletheia-core, no force, ls-remote verified. GitHub Release: https://github.com/wbic16/phext-lattice/releases/tag/v1.1.0. Evaluation: ~/workspace/phext-lattice-v1.1/EVALUATION.md.
