Coordinate: 47.11.7/12.13.16/12.11.16
Issued: 2026-11-06 23:57 CST
Request (verbatim): work through a PR to make libphext-rs v0.4.1 provably correct
Status: complete 2026-11-07 — PR #7 open on wbic16/libphext-rs (provable-0.4.1 -> exo)

Notes:
- Plan: (1) v0.4.1 changes: safe rewrite of expand/contract (kill the 2 unsafe blocks), version bump; (2) Charon+Aeneas toolchain on aletheia-core; (3) proofs/ Lean project in-repo: generated code, xxhash external model, specs + kernel-checked proofs for the tractable core; (4) PR with the trust ledger stated (translator trusted, floor = Lean kernel), remaining surface enumerated honestly.
- Closed 2026-11-07 ~02:45 CST. Toolchain built on aletheia-core (Charon at pin, Aeneas c5eb4a2, Lean 4.35.0). Crate prep on branch provable-0.4.1: v0.4.1 bump + zero unsafe (1d34089); helios dual-length fix (also merged to exo as dc58df21); five translator-driven rewrites, each bisected against minimal repros first: Vec::collect -> push loops; Pattern-trait str APIs -> manual split_on + byte contains; char<->int casts purged for byte-twin constants (SCROLL_BREAK_U8 etc.), create_summary byte scan; Iterator::chain/skip/take -> sequential/index loops; split_on returns owned Strings; phext parameters renamed input (Lean namespace collision). Tests 58/58 after every step. Extraction: zero errors, zero sorry; generated model = 301 defs; proofs/ lake build green (1,809 jobs) including three kernel-checked specs (advance_coordinate, default_coordinate, is_phext_break) in Libphext/Properties/Basic.lean. Trust ledger in PR #7 and proofs/README.md: 62 external axioms (incl. xxh3_128 uninterpreted; checksum verified only relative to its signature), explode/implode opaque (HashMap has no Lean model), translators + Aeneas stdlib models trusted. Branch published by API replay of the 8 local commits onto exo head dc58df21; remote head f36d2c2; blob hashes and 100755 script modes verified after publish.
