Notes:
- Will published libphext-rs v0.5.0 to crates.io himself (announced 2026-11-08 17:08 CST) — the publish act the freeze reserved to him. This closes the residual flagged in the v0.5.0 parity task (36.12.9/14.14.18/13.11.15): phext-notepad's native core pinned libphext by git rev e85d8b5 because crates.io max was 0.4.0 (no binary/seal).
- Work: on phext-notepad branch emise/ultra-open-fix (tip 636989ea), replace the git pin with version = "0.5.0" (features binary+xz unchanged), refresh Cargo.lock, re-verify the parity guarantees against the PUBLISHED crate (core suite, ultra full-fidelity + byte-identical serialize, seal/binary parity spot checks), push to the same branch.

